WEBVTT

00:13:28.792 --> 00:13:30.792
AG: Did you ever lose a player you wanted?

00:13:30.816 --> 00:13:33.226
JB: We certainly lost a couple players.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.143
One agent in particular
that we were trying to work on a deal

00:13:36.167 --> 00:13:38.226
for one of our young players
in Pittsburgh,

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:41.934
the agent too went
to my general manager at the time

00:13:41.958 --> 00:13:45.601
and complained a little bit
about my stance and where we're at.

00:13:45.625 --> 00:13:48.643
AG: Wait, you had an agent
complain to your boss about you?

00:13:48.667 --> 00:13:50.143
JB: Yep, had that happen,

00:13:50.167 --> 00:13:53.309
and he just said
that I was being very aggressive.

00:13:53.333 --> 00:13:56.059
AG: In class, Jason could laugh
about being ruthless.

00:13:56.083 --> 00:13:59.851
It was just a role play,
but now his career was on the line.

00:13:59.875 --> 00:14:02.643
Being a steamroller
was putting his future in jeopardy.